msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Mind if I dip out for a bit, Aniki? I wanna make sure Natsumi gets back to "
"the club safe and sound."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Sure, go right ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Thanks for waiting, Aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Rikiya. When did you figure out that was really Natsumi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Well, back when I was first handing her the pendant, I noticed a scar on "
"her right palm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "And that's how you knew?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Yup. It's from back when we were kids. She cut her hand on a piece of coral "
"while we were out swimming together. I had to bring her to the hospital and "
"everythin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"I don't think I gotta tell you that those kinds of scars don't really go "
"away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "So when I saw it there on her hand, I instantly knew it was Natsumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Heh, you're more perceptive than you look, Rikiya. So, how about a drink? I "
"think we could both unwind a bit after all that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "I'm down if you're down! Lead the way, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "You got 10,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

